/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-26-// A memory planner that uses a greedy algorithm to arrange buffers in memory
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-27-// to minimize the overall arena size needed.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-28-//
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-29-// The algorithm works like this:
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h:30://  - The client enters the buffer information through AddBuffer().
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-31-//  - When a function like GetOffsetForBuffer() is called, the
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-32-//    CalculateOffsetsIfNeeded() method is invoked.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-33-//  - If an up to date plan is not already present, one will be calculated.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-34-//  - The buffers are sorted in descending order of size.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-35-//  - The largest buffer is placed at offset zero.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-36-//  - The rest of the buffers are looped through in descending size order.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-37-//  - The other buffers that need to be in memory at the same time are found.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-38-//  - The first gap between simultaneously active buffers that the current
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-39-//    buffer fits into will be used.
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-40-//  - If no large-enough gap is found, the current buffer is placed after the
/home/user/sdk-alif/optional/modules/lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/memory_planner/greedy_memory_planner.h-41-//    last buffer that's simultaneously active.
